cts\n/Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/assessment/issue-triage/DESIGN.md:201:      \"verdict\": \"likely_resolved\",\n/Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/assessment/issue-triage/DESIGN.md:252:**CSS**: Inline in the base layout. Dark theme. Color-coded verdict/confidence\n/Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/assessment/issue-triage/DESIGN.md:317:5. **Write initial findings**: all issues with `verdict: \"pending\"`\n/Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/assessment/issue-triage/SKILL.md:72:issues set to `verdict: \"pending\"`, `confidence: \"PENDING\"`:\n/Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/assessment/issue-triage/SKILL.md:87:      \"verdict\": \"pending\",\n/Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/assessment/issue-triage/SKILL.md:162:verdict in `findings.json` (including those marked duplicate in Step 7):\n/Users/johnlee/.local/share/wt-utils/worktrees/73e0/stamped-in-practice/assessment/issue-triage/SKILL.md:193:   \"PR intended to close but forgot the closing keyword\" case → verdict\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
