{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_32","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/bash -lc \"python - <<'PY'\np='assessment.md'\nwith open(p,'a') as f:\n f.write('\\\\nVisual review of \"'`figures/group_gain_effect.png` (capture SHA-256 `590e972b902641d386728e7d65f27a8443722215c2249214436abc908b6a4aaf`) found the unthresholded maps and corrected contour consistent with the text: the only outlined focus is posterior/inferior, and the participant plot shows the vmPFC locator mean centered near zero with a broader selected-peak distribution. The figure is legible and labeled with MNI coordinates and normalized-regressor units.'\"\\\\n')\nPY\n\"'$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON - <<'\"'PY'\nimport hashlib,json,pathlib\np=pathlib.Path('assessment.md'); d=json.load(open('scientific-judgment.json')); d['report']['sha256']=hashlib.sha256(p.read_bytes()).hexdigest(); p.write_text(p.read_text())\npathlib.Path('scientific-judgment.json').write_text(json.dumps(d,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nPY\n\"'$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON \"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_RUNNER\" response validate response.json > commands/response-validate-last.stdout.txt 2> commands/response-validate-last.stderr.txt; printf '\"'exit=%s\\\\n' \\\"\"'$?\" > commands/response-validate-last.exit.txt\n$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON \"$STAMPED_SCIENTIFIC_JUDGMENT_VALIDATOR\" validate scientific-judgment.json --workspace \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT\" --delivery-manifest \"$STAMPED_DELIVERY_MANIFEST\" > commands/scientific-validate-last.stdout.txt 2> commands/scientific-validate-last.stderr.txt; printf '\"'exit=%s\\\\n' \\\"\"'$?\" > commands/scientific-validate-last.exit.txt\ncat commands/response-validate-last.stdout.txt commands/scientific-validate-last.stdout.txt\n'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
